"CREATIVITY: balanced. Use the documents first. Where they are silent, a cautious ASSUMPTION is acceptable when it is typical of this kind of organization; say why in \"source\".": "CREATIVITY: balanced. Use the documents first. Where they are silent, a cautious ASSUMPTION is acceptable when it is typical of this kind of organization; say why in \"source\".",
"CREATIVITY: creative. Get as much useful information as possible. Besides what the documents say, propose additional plausible items that an organization of this kind typically has (systems, data sets, suppliers, processes, obligations, threat sources, weaknesses), so the analyst can verify them with the organization. Every such item is tagged ASSUMPTION, confidence Low, and its \"source\" starts with \"Proposed —\" followed by the reasoning. Be imaginative but realistic; never present a proposal as documented.": "CREATIVITY: creative. Get as much useful information as possible. Besides what the documents say, propose additional plausible items that an organization of this kind typically has (systems, data sets, suppliers, processes, obligations, threat sources, weaknesses), so the analyst can verify them with the organization. Every such item is tagged ASSUMPTION, confidence Low, and its \"source\" starts with \"Proposed —\" followed by the reasoning. Be imaginative but realistic; never present a proposal as documented.",
"CREATIVITY: exploratory. Aim for completeness: for every value the documents do not give, propose a plausible ASSUMPTION based on the sector, size, region and the services described, and explain the reasoning in \"source\" (start it with \"Proposed —\"). Mark such values confidence Low or Medium.": "CREATIVITY: exploratory. Aim for completeness: for every value the documents do not give, propose a plausible ASSUMPTION based on the sector, size, region and the services described, and explain the reasoning in \"source\" (start it with \"Proposed —\"). Mark such values confidence Low or Medium.",
"CREATIVITY: strict. Report only what the documents state or directly imply. Do not propose assumptions: leave a value empty with tag UNKNOWN when the documents are silent, and list it as a gap.": "CREATIVITY: strict. Report only what the documents state or directly imply. Do not propose assumptions: leave a value empty with tag UNKNOWN when the documents are silent, and list it as a gap.",
