"Formally accepted": "Formellement accepté",
"Format": "Format",
"Format: see docs/SIEM-SOAR-IMPORT-FORMAT.md (envelope crg-siem-import/#).": "Format : voir docs/SIEM-SOAR-IMPORT-FORMAT.md (enveloppe crg-siem-import/#).",
